{#- The Reflections panel (CODE-SITE-18, SITE step 27; spec Part 3).
    Include on every page that asks the reader to write. Set before including:
      reflectionIds    the wopReflections bucket ids this page writes to
      reflectionTitle  the page's readable title
      reflectionFile   the <page> part of a download's file name
      reflectionMode   optional: "continue" where the reader is working through an interactive
                       module (Seeking Jesus); otherwise "read". Picks the G5 line for My questions
                       (Teaching Practices v1.1, gate G5; wording in src/_data/g5.js).
    The store (js/wop-reflections.js) is loaded on every page by layouts/base.njk. -#}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/wop-reflections-panel.css?v={{ site.version }}">
<script>window.WOP_REFLECTION_PAGE = { ids: {{ reflectionIds | dump | safe }}, title: {{ reflectionTitle | dump | safe }}, fileSlug: {{ reflectionFile | dump | safe }}, g5: {{ g5.first[reflectionMode or "read"] | dump | safe }}, css: "/css/wop-reflections-panel.css?v={{ site.version }}" };</script>
<script src="/js/wop-reflections-panel.js?v={{ site.version }}" defer></script>
